/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (      Skillup Bharat offers comprehensive Java Fullstack training designed to equip students with in-demand skills for the modern tech industry. The course covers both front-end and back-end development, ensuring a complete understanding of fullstack development. Learners start with core Java programming, mastering object-oriented principles, data structures, and algorithms. This foundational knowledge is essential for building dynamic web applications.)
/E (      Skillup Bharat offers comprehensive Java Fullstack training designed to equip students with in-demand skills for the modern tech industry. The course covers both front-end and back-end development, ensuring a complete understanding of fullstack development. Learners start with core Java programming, mastering object-oriented principles, data structures, and algorithms. This foundational knowledge is essential for building dynamic web applications.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
