/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (        In addition to Java, the course includes front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, enabling learners to create responsive and interactive user interfaces. Popular frameworks like Angular or React are also part of the curriculum, providing practical experience in building client-side applications.)
/E (        In addition to Java, the course includes front-end technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, enabling learners to create responsive and interactive user interfaces. Popular frameworks like Angular or React are also part of the curriculum, providing practical experience in building client-side applications.)
